    "section": "Examples",
    "text": "Examples\n\nCode — div-based fragments\n\nView Example\nSource Code\n\n\n\n\n\nCode — slide-based\n\nView Example\nSource Code\n\n\n\n\n\nSVG output — ggplot2 / grid\n\nView Example\nSource Code\n\n\n\n\n\nSVG output — other R packages\n\nView Example\nSource Code\n\n\n\n\n\nSVG output — Python\n\nView Example\nSource Code\n\n\n\n\n\nSVG output — Julia\n\nView Example\nSource Code\n\n\n\nCharts rendered via Quarto’s Observable JS ({ojs}) engine — D3, Observable Plot, Vega-Lite — don’t animate yet (see Limitations above); no example is shown here for that reason.\n\nFull Source Code"
  },
